Some people mentioned the General Belgrano during the Falklands war but there were some instances during Operation Praying Mantis (1988) that probably count.

&nbsp;

It had already been hit by aircraft a couple times but the Iranian frigate Sahand took a harpoon hit from an American destroyer right before it caught on fire, then sunk.

A lot of people have mentioned that it looks reminiscent of the logo from a popular sci-fi franchise, but if you look at the emblem the military branch responsible for space operations has been using for decades, it's a way more obvious match.

